{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55112","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看天马，辰戌亦同前。\n（京本注：「魁罡也。\n」）若在支干（京本作「干支」）应空（辛本、川本、京本作「定」）发，更还加季不（京本作「主」）留连，人马闹（京本作「更」）喧喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}